    "font" : "CMR12",
    "font size" : 11.955,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "The ideal generated by the entries of w2(6) is (P1,...,P5,b12345). It is a hyperplane section of the ideal of submaximal pfaffians of the skew-symmetric matrix defined by the variables bijk. The matrix of w2(1) is a presentation matrix of this ideal. On the other hand, the top component of the critical representation W0 contains information about the spinor structure of this related ideal."
